content:
Priya: Heads up - NovaLabs onboarding spike. Their SPA does a preflight on every route + service-worker also pings preflight on fetch events. We're seeing 200->429 oscillation during their staged rollout.
Sam: can you paste the pattern?
Priya: simplified flow:
```js
// main app
router.on('route', () => { preflight(); });
// service worker
self.addEventListener('fetch', evt => { if (shouldWarm(evt)) fetch('/api/preflight'); });
```
Luis: ugh double-warmup per client. Couple of quick asks: 1) stop preflight from SW when app already did it in the tab, 2) memoize ephemeral token so refreshes don't race, 3) add x-client-id so edge can attribute.
Priya: they use 45s token TTL and refresh on visibilitychange. That causes many parallel refreshes when users navigate.
Sam: propose client change snippet:
```js
let _token = null;
async function getEphemeral(){
  if (_token && !isExpiring(_token)) return _token;
  if (!window.__tokenInflight) window.__tokenInflight = fetch('/auth/ephemeral').finally(()=> setTimeout(()=> window.__tokenInflight = null, 30_000));
  const t = await window.__tokenInflight;
  _token = t; return _token;
}
```
This ensures a single inflight refresh per tab.
Luis: also debounce service-worker warmup: only run SW preflight if no client tab has an active session marker. Use clients.matchAll() to check.
Priya: we asked customer to add x-client-id header: `x-client-id: novalabs-web-01` and update user-agent to include app version. They pushed a quick patch.
Sam: infra recommendation: create a 24h warmup window / soft quota bump while they rollout, and enable a temporary 2x per-client throughput for the new client id. OnboardBot can you open a ticket?
OnboardBot: Created ticket #NOVA-ONB-19 for temporary throughput increase (24h), owner: Luis, ETA: 1h.
Priya: after the client patch we saw immediate grouping of warmup requests and 429s dropped. Logs: 
[2026-02-11T09:12:03Z] preflight novalabs-web-01 200
[2026-02-11T09:12:20Z] preflight novalabs-web-01 429
[2026-02-11T09:12:46Z] preflight novalabs-web-01 200 retry
Sam: good. Follow-up CS checklist for handoff: ["deploy client memoize patch","disable SW preflight when tab active","ensure x-client-id present","monitor dashboard 2h","ops temp bump ticket NOVA-ONB-19"]. Send to customer with rollback steps.
Luis: also offered a small SDK helper function we can ship in a patch to opt-in token coalescing and SW-safe preflight guard. Customer said yes.
Priya: will confirm when they finish rollout. Closing when they verify warmup stable for 2 hours. :party_parrot:
